01:31.487 --> 01:36.497
The Directive to Take the Nine Tails

02:11.697 --> 02:16.317
This should surprise
those inefficient Akatsuki.

02:36.527 --> 02:38.567
Lord Orochimaru, there's an overload!

02:38.567 --> 02:39.897
The system won't hold!

02:40.737 --> 02:41.737
It's fine!

02:41.817 --> 02:43.277
This is excellent!

02:49.817 --> 02:50.697
Yes!

02:55.237 --> 02:57.357
Now stand!

02:57.647 --> 03:00.607
Take the Nine Tails from
the child of the Fourth...

03:00.697 --> 03:02.107
I can't control it!

03:02.527 --> 03:04.567
You're going to be
the ultimate existence...

03:04.567 --> 03:06.947
... that surpasses the Jinchuriki!

03:09.397 --> 03:11.357
W-What are you doing?

03:12.197 --> 03:15.697
I am your creator...

03:22.447 --> 03:23.647
Lord Orochimaru!

03:30.697 --> 03:32.647
After I've come this far...

03:32.987 --> 03:35.237
Please get to safety, Lord Orochimaru!

03:35.317 --> 03:36.107
Hurry!

04:19.277 --> 04:20.777
Curse that Orochimaru...

04:21.357 --> 04:23.697
Not only did he desert the Akatsuki,

04:23.777 --> 04:28.237
he stole the blueprint of
the Gedo Statue and made this thing...

04:28.317 --> 04:31.197
So this is to capture
the Tailed Beast, after all...

04:31.737 --> 04:34.697
I wasn't able to ascertain
all of its gimmicks,

04:34.777 --> 04:37.237
but I restored its movements.

04:38.527 --> 04:41.697
And added a couple
of extra features.

04:47.567 --> 04:50.777
Now this thing is ours to control.

04:51.777 --> 04:54.357
Itachi, go capture the Nine Tails.

05:25.447 --> 05:27.777
Hm? You haven't been back
to the village in ages.

05:27.857 --> 05:29.897
Don't you want to go and say hello?

05:30.567 --> 05:32.317
I'm not interested right now.

05:44.697 --> 05:46.607
All right! It's all here!

05:46.737 --> 05:48.897
The assorted offal is here!

05:49.027 --> 05:50.357
Oh, and waitress?

05:50.697 --> 05:51.147
Yes?

05:51.237 --> 05:53.317
Another plate of skirt steak
and loin meat!

05:53.397 --> 05:54.697
– Skirt steak and loin, okay!
– Oh, and these...

05:54.777 --> 05:56.607
Can you take them away?

05:56.697 --> 05:57.447
Certainly!

05:57.527 --> 06:01.317
Hey, you know, even if
this is on Asuma...

06:01.397 --> 06:06.397
I don't think it's right to start
before our host gets here.

06:07.197 --> 06:08.527
Don't worry about it.

06:09.987 --> 06:14.607
He probably stopped by Kurenai Sensei's
place and forgot all about us.

06:14.817 --> 06:19.897
Did you know that Kakashi Sensei
hasn't left Naruto's side at all?

06:20.647 --> 06:23.397
Naruto's really doing his best.

06:24.697 --> 06:29.317
For Naruto, it's more like...

06:30.567 --> 06:33.897
Ninja Art: Beast Mimicry!
Man Beast Clone!

06:35.147 --> 06:36.567
Fang Over Fang!

06:41.237 --> 06:43.567
<i>I am not going to lose to him!</i>

06:44.487 --> 06:45.567
Fang Over Fang!

06:49.107 --> 06:52.567
<i>I'm ready. I can go at any time.</i>

06:53.067 --> 06:56.777
<i>It's because I'm tired</i>
<i>of being left behind.</i>

06:59.487 --> 07:01.527
<i>Even if I can't stand next to him...</i>

07:02.067 --> 07:07.447
<i>I want to get to the point</i>
<i>where I can follow close behind Naruto...</i>

07:09.447 --> 07:11.857
You made Food Pills today too?

07:12.647 --> 07:15.487
I figured I'd cheer him on by giving
him some nutrition at least.

07:16.607 --> 07:17.697
You can have one if you like.

07:18.107 --> 07:19.567
No thank you...

07:22.237 --> 07:23.607
You're holding up well.

07:23.857 --> 07:25.737
What is it about him that
makes you go so far?

07:43.897 --> 07:45.777
<b>SIT</b>

07:43.897 --> 07:45.777
I'm counting on you, Yamato.

07:46.197 --> 07:49.607
You have to keep the Nine Tails' chakra
inside of Naruto in check.

07:50.647 --> 07:52.107
So far, it's stable.

07:53.237 --> 07:55.607
I've got to do this!

07:56.147 --> 07:57.397
Damn it!

07:57.487 --> 08:00.147
I can't be wasting time like this.

08:00.737 --> 08:02.487
I've got to keep going...

08:02.947 --> 08:04.397
I've got to keep going...

08:05.237 --> 08:06.607
More!

08:25.987 --> 08:27.817
Go to Naruto!

08:38.947 --> 08:40.317
What? What happened?!

08:40.397 --> 08:41.777
Is everyone all right?

08:42.527 --> 08:43.197
This is...

08:48.857 --> 08:50.647
– Who are you?!
– Don't move!

08:56.237 --> 08:57.397
If that's the case, I'll...

08:57.487 --> 08:59.067
This is bad!

09:01.987 --> 09:04.027
Naruto!

09:04.447 --> 09:05.607
Huh?

09:07.317 --> 09:09.527
Please come quick!

09:17.647 --> 09:19.647
Even Neji is having a hard time!

09:20.567 --> 09:22.317
Who the hell are you?

09:27.607 --> 09:29.107
How dare you do this to
everyone in the village...

09:29.527 --> 09:31.357
You're fighting me now!

09:31.447 --> 09:33.987
Be careful. He's strong!

09:34.067 --> 09:37.237
Yes... Even I was no match for him.

09:37.567 --> 09:41.237
Yeah, but I'm in the middle
of training and I'm busy.

09:41.317 --> 09:43.197
I'm not going to waste any time on him.

09:43.777 --> 09:45.947
I'll take care of him in one blow!

09:47.197 --> 09:49.277
Multi-Shadow Clone Jutsu!

09:57.527 --> 09:58.777
Here I come!

10:03.697 --> 10:04.947
Damn it!

10:08.277 --> 10:09.777
This guy's strong!

10:12.447 --> 10:13.447
Why you—!

10:19.607 --> 10:20.277
Huh?

10:20.487 --> 10:21.147
Huh?

10:21.647 --> 10:22.317
Huh?

10:42.027 --> 10:44.147
N-Naruto...?

10:44.777 --> 10:47.447
He certainly looks like Naruto.

10:47.607 --> 10:49.697
Our friend's a Mecha Naruto!

10:49.777 --> 10:50.947
Don't call the enemy a friend!

10:51.197 --> 10:52.027
Naruto!

10:53.147 --> 10:55.027
This is a one-on-one match!

10:55.897 --> 10:57.987
Hey, Mecha-Me.

10:58.567 --> 11:00.647
I don't know who made you, but...

11:01.357 --> 11:04.147
I'm not going to lose to a fake...

11:04.237 --> 11:05.027
Huh?

11:05.107 --> 11:08.277
Wait a minute. I'm not using
the Nine Tails' chakra!

11:09.107 --> 11:11.817
Hey, what're you doing?!

11:17.817 --> 11:18.897
Kakashi!

11:19.067 --> 11:23.777
I think that guy is extracting
the Nine Tails' chakra out of Naruto.

11:24.777 --> 11:26.697
If this continues...

11:26.777 --> 11:29.697
Against the enormous power
of the Nine Tails' chakra, Naruto will...

11:29.777 --> 11:31.027
This isn't good...

11:35.317 --> 11:36.987
Shadow Clone Jutsu!

11:39.107 --> 11:40.317
It's tiny!

11:40.397 --> 11:42.697
Damn it!
Mini Rasengan!

11:44.447 --> 11:46.067
I don't have any strength...

11:48.027 --> 11:48.947
Lightning Blade!

11:52.857 --> 11:55.067
The flow of the Nine Tails' chakra
has stopped.

11:55.777 --> 11:58.857
I see... In order to extract
the Nine Tails' chakra,

11:58.947 --> 12:01.027
he needs to be within
a certain distance.

12:01.277 --> 12:03.697
Then we'll draw Naruto away
from him!

12:15.317 --> 12:17.607
<b>FOUND HIM</b>

12:35.737 --> 12:36.737
How come...?

12:37.607 --> 12:38.737
Don't worry.

12:39.317 --> 12:42.737
Only ANBU know about
this secret underground passage.

12:43.697 --> 12:45.237
Huh?! Damn that guy!

12:45.317 --> 12:47.107
I'm not kidding! I'll pulverize him!

12:47.197 --> 12:48.607
Hey, don't get so excited!

12:50.277 --> 12:51.237
Did he find us?

12:51.317 --> 12:53.647
He's probably just attacking blindly.

12:54.107 --> 12:55.567
Let me at him, Kakashi Sensei!

12:56.067 --> 12:59.237
Otherwise, the village will destroyed!

13:14.697 --> 13:15.987
Run!

13:20.147 --> 13:23.357
You're right. He's just attacking
anything in sight.

13:24.647 --> 13:27.197
Naruto, you can't beat him.

13:28.107 --> 13:29.567
Right now, the only thing
we can do is run away.

13:40.357 --> 13:41.147
No!

13:41.487 --> 13:42.897
Look at the destruction!

13:47.187 --> 13:48.857
I'm telling you, I'll win for sure!

13:49.147 --> 13:52.987
Listen... He's not only taking
the Nine Tails' chakra!

13:53.777 --> 13:56.777
Neji used his Byakugan to
look inside his body,

13:56.857 --> 13:59.487
and confirmed what seems to be
the Eight Trigrams Sealing Formula.

13:59.887 --> 14:04.177
In other words, that thing's also
a vessel to seal the Nine Tails.

14:05.387 --> 14:08.047
He intends to suck out your chakra,

14:08.137 --> 14:10.677
weaken you,
and then capture the Nine Tails.

14:11.297 --> 14:12.427
In other words...

14:12.507 --> 14:15.217
if the Nine Tails is taken
from you, you will die.

14:17.347 --> 14:19.387
A replacement vessel for Naruto...

14:19.637 --> 14:23.597
To go through the trouble of making it
look just like Naruto is morbid.

14:24.257 --> 14:25.547
Damn!

14:26.047 --> 14:28.717
He lost sight of you and disappeared.

14:30.007 --> 14:31.887
His whereabouts are unknown,

14:31.967 --> 14:35.047
but he's sure to appear
when you show up.

14:36.257 --> 14:38.757
When that happens,
the village will become a battlefield.

14:40.967 --> 14:42.597
So what're you trying to tell me?

14:43.597 --> 14:45.047
Leave the village, Naruto!

14:45.507 --> 14:47.007
Are you getting rid of me?!

14:47.177 --> 14:48.137
Silence!

14:49.137 --> 14:51.047
Let me finish!

14:52.547 --> 14:56.007
We'll use Naruto to lure that
guy out of the village,

14:56.007 --> 14:57.257
and then bring him down.

14:58.387 --> 15:00.847
However, we can't let
Naruto get close.

15:00.967 --> 15:02.177
Can you do it?

15:02.927 --> 15:04.507
That's a tough question...

15:05.097 --> 15:06.387
But we have to do it.

15:07.137 --> 15:10.347
Naturally, we need Yamato to
control the Nine Tails' chakra.

15:11.177 --> 15:13.097
Then besides me,

15:13.177 --> 15:16.547
we'll need Sensory-type ninja
and long-distance combat specialists.

15:25.677 --> 15:27.597
Man, what a fancy palanquin!

15:27.677 --> 15:30.927
I didn't know you rode on something
so fancy, Granny Tsunade!

15:30.967 --> 15:34.137
The Feudal Lord gave it to me
for diplomatic purposes.

15:35.137 --> 15:37.347
It's not my style,
so I've never used it.

15:38.007 --> 15:40.427
Yamato, ride in this palanquin
with Naruto,

15:40.507 --> 15:44.047
suppress the Nine Tails' chakra
and don't let it leak out.

15:44.507 --> 15:45.467
Understood.

15:45.547 --> 15:48.047
But if that thing comes within
close proximity,

15:48.137 --> 15:50.847
the chakra will leak out,
no matter what I do.

15:52.137 --> 15:53.717
There's no way I'll let it get near him.

15:54.047 --> 15:55.717
To make sure that doesn't happen...

15:55.967 --> 15:57.507
– We're here!
– We're here!

16:02.217 --> 16:03.297
Shikamaru!

16:03.387 --> 16:04.097
Hey!

16:04.217 --> 16:05.097
Neji!

16:06.007 --> 16:06.967
Choji!

16:07.097 --> 16:09.967
All the members from that time
are back together again.

16:10.177 --> 16:10.887
Kiba!

16:10.967 --> 16:13.177
So? Are you surprised?

16:13.467 --> 16:17.177
Well, I knew that you'd be here, but...

16:18.257 --> 16:19.007
Um...

16:19.007 --> 16:22.137
You want to get back
to training, right, Naruto?

16:23.757 --> 16:26.597
It's a drag, but we'll help you out.

16:33.007 --> 16:36.047
How come I'm stuck in this cramped space
with you, Yamato Sensei?

16:36.097 --> 16:38.137
You took the words
right out of my mouth.

16:38.967 --> 16:40.847
We're palanquin bearers?!

16:41.467 --> 16:42.467
Listen!

16:42.547 --> 16:45.347
About this Mecha Naruto...

16:46.097 --> 16:49.677
Until you destroy Mecha Naruto,
don't even think about returning!

16:50.007 --> 16:51.177
Now go!

16:53.967 --> 16:57.927
W-What's this Mecha Naruto?!

17:02.887 --> 17:06.217
I knew I was going to be left behind again.

17:07.097 --> 17:10.097
That's because my beetles told me.

17:16.547 --> 17:17.427
It's coming!

17:19.047 --> 17:20.347
That guy... can fly?!

17:28.547 --> 17:30.597
<b>SICK</b>

17:37.007 --> 17:38.547
<b>MISSILE</b>

17:40.097 --> 17:41.967
He fired a big one this time!

17:42.347 --> 17:44.217
This is bad!
That thing is bad!

17:44.427 --> 17:45.257
Leave it to me!

17:45.347 --> 17:46.217
Shino?!

17:46.797 --> 17:49.677
That's because I've had it
with being the only one...

17:50.847 --> 17:53.097
– Shino!
– Shino!

17:54.097 --> 17:55.717
... left behind!

18:04.177 --> 18:05.177
What?!

18:15.177 --> 18:20.427
<b>TEAM 8 SHINO ABURAME
OUT OF COMMISSION</b>

18:21.007 --> 18:23.347
Aw, stop it, will you?!
That face of yours!!

18:23.967 --> 18:25.547
– I'm okay...
– Stop! Stop it!

18:25.637 --> 18:27.927
I'm not sick...
I'm really not sick!

18:28.007 --> 18:29.007
Are you sure?

18:33.797 --> 18:35.137
Mid-air 150 meters!

18:35.427 --> 18:37.177
He's hurling Mecha Bombs!

18:39.597 --> 18:41.677
The forest! Run into the forest!

18:49.847 --> 18:51.597
Kakashi Sensei, switch with me!

18:52.007 --> 18:52.887
What's going on?

18:53.097 --> 18:55.097
We'll bring him down... With shadows!

19:01.137 --> 19:01.967
<b>FOUND HIM</b>

19:13.717 --> 19:15.717
He's going wild.

19:17.847 --> 19:20.717
Keep shooting! Come on.

19:20.967 --> 19:22.427
Come on!

19:30.637 --> 19:32.217
Shadow Possession Jutsu...

19:38.467 --> 19:39.757
Success!

19:40.347 --> 19:41.507
And now...

19:41.927 --> 19:43.007
Ninja Art!

19:43.097 --> 19:44.797
Shadow Strangle Jutsu!

19:55.097 --> 19:56.137
Huh?

20:01.137 --> 20:02.097
Huh?

20:02.717 --> 20:04.717
Huh?!

20:07.007 --> 20:10.137
The shadow broke!

20:25.257 --> 20:28.757
I-I need more shadows...

20:29.597 --> 20:36.097
<b>TEAM 10 SHIKAMARU NARA
WITHDRAWN</b>

20:37.757 --> 20:38.887
Shikamaru...

20:40.927 --> 20:43.007
Mecha Naruto... is coming!

20:43.097 --> 20:46.097
Being in the palanquin
is more dangerous!

20:51.677 --> 20:53.797
Shizune, request assistance
from the Sand.

20:54.217 --> 20:56.047
Tell them Naruto is in serious trouble!

20:57.847 --> 21:00.137
We will not let him have Naruto!

